/*
 * This file implements the type-inference logic used by the Ymir compiler to
 * determine compatible types and value forms in expressions. It provides:
 *
 *   - implicit cast inference,
 *   - reference-based value adaptation,
 *   - branching type inference (if/else, match arms, ternaries),
 *   - lambda inference from function/delegate types,
 *   - and class-ancestor inference for polymorphic branches.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::type::infer
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/type/infer.yr
 * @Author(s):
